<title>POLAND: Polish June unemployment estimated at 11.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Polish June unemployment estimated at 11.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registered unemployment in Poland fell 0.1 percent to 11.6 percent of the workforce in June according to early data from regional employment offices, the labour minister said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The rate of unemployment fell by 0.1 percent in June, these are the figures from employment offices,&quot; Tadeusz Zielinski told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
